## 3. Automatic publishing-time optimization

Self-improving scheduling

I want this feature to go beyond a conventional scheduling calendar.

The system should learn when each audience is most responsive and automatically adjust future publishing times.

### How it works

1. Collect historical publishing data.
2. Record the date and exact time of each post.
3. Measure performance at different intervals after publication.
4. Compare similar videos published at different times.
5. Identify the strongest time windows.
6. Recommend better publishing slots.
7. Automatically update future schedules if enabled.
8. Continue learning from new results.

